rience.\n\nJoin a live session from your Meta Quest headset by scanning a QR code, no complex setup required. Your facilitator manages the session from a web dashboard, guiding you through immersive environments and real-time scenarios designed to build confidence and sharpen communication skills.\n\n  Key features:\n  - Live facilitator-led VR training sessions\n  - Lifelike characters you can talk to with your own voice\n  - Realistic environments, from a presentation stage and a bakery to a courtroom and a crisis team meeting room\n  - Hand tracking or controllers, your choice\n  - Secure QR pairing, join a session in seconds\n  - Session recording for the debrief with your facilitator\n\nBuilt for teams, trainers and organizations that believe practice in an immersive environment leads to real-world results.", "short_description": "Greenpill is an immersive VR training platform for high-stakes communication. Join live sessions led by a facilitator, talk with lifelike characters in realistic environments, from presentations and customer conversations to crisis meetings, and get feedback."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://greenpill.tech/privacy-policy-greenpill.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Greenpill Technologies BV", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://greenpill.tech/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes